      "content": "May 31, 2024, AK email  \nI am realizing that the point of Wondrous Wisdom is to disentangle three minds\n\n- Unconscious, which think in terms of answers, provided by our neurons\n\n- Conscious, which thinks in terms of questions, expressed by our conceptual languages\n\n- Consciousness, which thinks in terms of investigations, disentangling the other two minds\n\n---\n\n---\n\n- WW — language, language club. Learned as with cooking/dancing, not with books. Hence Projects for the embodied logic and rhythm of [https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su618O5l](https://coda.io/d/_d0SvdI3KSto/_su618O5l) . \n\n- Turing complete : Programming language :: WW : Frameworks\n\n",
